🎯 WHAT IS THE 3D MODEL?

The 3D model is trained on 3 voice quality dimensions simultaneously:
  • Dimension 1: Breathiness
  • Dimension 2: Roughness
  • Dimension 3: Strain

It's a **multi-task model** that predicts all 3 dimensions at once.


═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

🔍 WHAT WAS THE PROBLEM?

Error: "Missing key generate"
  • The 3D model test data has a different JSON structure
  • It uses "generate" key instead of "text"
  • The evaluation script only knew about PVQD format


═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

