1. Updated eval_multi_task.py
   ✓ Added get_annotation_fields() function
   ✓ Handles multiple data formats:
     - PVQD: {"path": "...", "text": "..."}
     - 3D: {"path": "...", "generate": "..."}
     - Alternative: {"audio": "...", "score": "..."}

2. Created configs/config_3d.yaml
   ✓ Pre-configured with PVQD test files
   ✓ Ready to use immediately
   ✓ No manual setup needed

