📦 WHAT WAS IMPLEMENTED
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

✅ Audio Augmentation Module (audio_augmentation.py)
   - 5 augmentation methods
   - Voice Activity Detection (VAD)
   - Configurable parameters
   - Efficient implementations

✅ Dataset Integration (dataset.py)
   - SALMONNDataset with augmentation support
   - MultiTaskDataset with augmentation support
   - Only applies to training set
   - Backward compatible

✅ Training Integration (train.py)
   - Pass augmentation config to datasets
   - Only for training set
   - Validation/test sets unaffected

✅ Configuration (configs/config_pvqd.yaml)
   - Augmentation section added
   - Default settings (disabled)
   - Documented parameters

✅ Testing & Verification (test_augmentation.py)
   - Tests all 5 augmentation methods
   - Generates example audio files
   - Verifies installation

✅ Setup Script (setup_augmentation.sh)
   - Automated dependency installation
   - Verification checks
   - Error handling


🎵 FIVE AUGMENTATION METHODS
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

1. SPEED (Time Stretching)
   Range: 0.9x - 1.1x
   Purpose: Handle different speaking rates
   Speed: ⚡ Fast
   Preserves: Voice quality ✓

2. LOUDNESS (Perceptual Loudness)
   Range: -5 to +5 LUFS
   Purpose: Handle different recording levels
   Speed: ⚡ Fast
   Preserves: Voice quality ✓

3. CROP (Random Crop with VAD)
   Range: 0.5s - full length
   Purpose: Variable-length utterances
   Speed: ⚡ Fast
   Preserves: Voice quality ✓
   Special: Voice Activity Detection prevents silence

4. NOISE (Background Noise)
   Range: SNR 15-30 dB
   Purpose: Background noise robustness
   Speed: ⚡ Fast
   Preserves: Voice quality ✓

5. REVERB (Room Reverb)
   Range: Room scale 0.3-0.7
   Purpose: Different acoustic environments
   Speed: 🐢 Slower
   Preserves: Voice quality ✓


