🚀 QUICK START (5 MINUTES)
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Step 1: Install Dependencies (2 minutes)
────────────────────────────────────────
pip install librosa scipy soundfile pyloudnorm

Step 2: Test Augmentation (1 minute)
────────────────────────────────────
python test_augmentation.py

Step 3: Enable in Config (1 minute)
───────────────────────────────────
nano configs/config_pvqd.yaml

Find this section:
  augmentation:
    enable: False

Change to:
  augmentation:
    enable: True
    prob: 0.5
    types:
      - "speed"
      - "loudness"
      - "crop"
      - "noise"
      - "reverb"

Step 4: Run Training (1 minute)
───────────────────────────────
python train.py --cfg-path configs/config_pvqd.yaml


