  Train: data epoch: [0]  [  5/200]  eta: 0:02:33  lr: 0.00001500  loss: 2.3000
  Train: data epoch: [0]  [ 10/200]  eta: 0:02:31  lr: 0.00002000  loss: 2.1000
  ...
  Train: data epoch: [1]  [  0/200]  eta: 0:02:41  lr: 0.00003000  loss: 1.8000
  Train: data epoch: [1]  [  5/200]  eta: 0:02:33  lr: 0.00002900  loss: 1.7000

关键指标：
